┌─ gdoc ────────────────────────────────────────── v2.9.0 ─┐
│ Usage: gdoc <command> [flags]                            │
├─ Read ───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ read                                                     │
│   a document as text, one tab or all of them, with the   │
│   suggestions marked                                     │
│ comments                                                 │
│   the threads, their quotes and who wrote them           │
├─ Write into a doc ───────────────────────────────────────┤
│ propose                                                  │
│   a change to quoted words as a native suggestion, with  │
│   a comment beside it                                    │
│ reply                                                    │
│   one robot reply into a thread nobody has closed        │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
